        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions 12\" Modern Shower Door Pulls</b>\r\n<p> \r\nThis very contemporary designed shower door pull set is constructed of durable non rusting aluminum and finished  in your choice of Satin Nickel or Polished Chrome.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nBelow is a pair of First Impressions 3007/300 shower door pulls in Satin Nickel finish mounted back to back (pulls screw together). They make a very stunning large rectangle shape, very modern and contemporary. \r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-12S-specifications.gif?v=1704354714\" width=\"560\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impressions 3007/300 door pulls\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of First Impressions 3007/300 Modern Shower Door Pulls\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 11-13/16\" (300 MM)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 11-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Width: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Non Rusting Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Available Finishes: 2</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Packaged with 2 door pulls and includes all the hardware for back to back mounting on 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass shower doors. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Pair (2 Pulls)</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>** This Item is Discontinued</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<br><br>",
